  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "9e719d8d-bb48-496b-a53b-2d73e4d7dc9a",
      "name": "Doc - Webhook Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        -1296
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Webhook Input Contract\n\n`POST /common/notify`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"platform_code\": \"hrp\",\n  \"email_type\": \"welcome\",\n  \"to_email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"user_name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n    \"invitation_accept_url\": \"...\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- **platform_code** (required, string) — identifies the calling app. Must match a row in the **Platforms** sheet.\n- **email_type** (required, string) — which notification to send (e.g. `welcome`, `invitation`, `password_reset`). Must match a row in the **Templates** sheet.\n- **to_email** (required, string) — recipient address.\n- **data** (optional, object) — per-call placeholders, e.g. a URL, a user's name, a role. Merged on top of the platform's static context (`platform_name`, `platform_description`) to build the Mailjet template variables. Keys must match the placeholders used inside that Mailjet template.\n\n### Responses\n- `400` — missing platform_code / email_type / to_email\n- `422` — platform_code or email_type not found in the sheets\n- `502` — Mailjet send failed\n- `200` — sent",
        "height": 1148,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c31eb273-43d2-4b3b-ad84-58f1b843bf27",
      "name": "Doc - Google Sheet Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -1296
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Sheet Setup (required)\n\nBoth Sheets nodes below need the **same spreadsheet's Document ID** and a Google Sheets credential attached — pick them from the dropdowns in each node.\n\n### Tab: `Platforms`\n| column | required | notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| platform_code | yes | key — matches webhook's `platform_code` |\n| platform_name | yes | sent as `{{platform_name}}` in templates |\n| platform_description | yes | sent as `{{platform_description}}` |\n| from_email | yes | Mailjet sender address for this app |\n| from_name | no | falls back to platform_name |\n\n### Tab: `Templates`\n| column | required | notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| email_type | yes | key — matches webhook's `email_type` |\n| mailjet_template_id | yes | numeric Mailjet template ID |\n| description | no | human note only, not used by the flow |\n\nOnboarding a new app or a new email type = add a row to the sheet. No workflow edit needed.",
        "height": 1148,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7e21ecab-4a9a-43f8-bb77-95a8e6030715",
      "name": "Webhook - Notification Trigger",
      "webhookId": "f6e7edc0-b76f-495b-8cb4-70ca054c2a7d",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -16,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "common/notify",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "80c92c4c-b403-4622-8122-2a178c6529d9",
      "name": "Parse & Validate Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        224,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $json.body ?? {};\nconst platform_code = body.platform_code;\nconst email_type = body.email_type;\nconst to_email = body.to_email;\nconst data = body.data ?? {};\n\nconst missing = [];\nif (!platform_code) missing.push('platform_code');\nif (!email_type) missing.push('email_type');\nif (!to_email) missing.push('to_email');\n\nif (missing.length) {\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      ok: false,\n      error: `Missing required field(s): ${missing.join(', ')}`\n    }\n  }];\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ok: true,\n    platform_code,\n    email_type,\n    to_email,\n    data\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c6b28d93-10f5-4ab9-8c08-b74c6d00c076",
